--- BASE block ---
Contract §3/§5 P-1: path object first — an unknown or non-UUID account is 404 before any semantic query validation, so `q` is only validated after the account exists. Typed query params (status/cluster_id/page/page_size/ sort/order) and undeclared params are rejected by the route before the handler, hence 422 even for an unknown account. This is not an information-leak hardening measure: the endpoint is USER_ADMIN only.
